        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📅 Roadmap — The Future of Neon Shot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(All updates will be FREE)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short Term (0–2 Months)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ New Levels</strong> – Trickier puzzles and fresh physics obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode</strong> – Capture your best neon shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Polish</strong> – Smoother controls and enhanced visual effects</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mid Term (2–4 Months)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 New Neon Zones</strong> – Unique themes with new gameplay twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Mechanics</strong> – Portals, moving platforms, laser traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Options</strong> – Play at your own pace: relaxed or hardcore</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Long Term (4–6 Months)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor + Workshop</strong> – Build and share your own creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Challenges</strong> – A fresh mini challenge every day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experimental Co-op Mode</strong> – Team up with a friend to solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack DLC</strong> – A standalone synthwave music pack</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Shot</strong> is a fast-paced physics puzzle game that tests both your reflexes and your mind.<br>Inside a glowing digital maze, your goal is to <strong>pull, aim, and launch</strong> a small neon square with precision. Reaching the target may look simple, but every shot and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time, outsmart cleverly designed obstacles, and conquer each level with skill and strategy. With <strong>intuitive controls</strong>, <strong>deep mechanics</strong>, and a striking neon aesthetic, Neon Shot blends the spirit of classic arcades with modern physics-based gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick &amp; Launch Mechanics</strong> – Pull, aim, release. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Puzzles</strong> – Gravity, friction, ramps, barriers, and more across handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Challenge Mode</strong> – Every second counts. Beat the level, then beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Atmosphere &amp; Synthwave Style</strong> – Retro-futuristic visuals meet electronic soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill + Strategy Balance</strong> – Limited shots and unusual solutions encourage creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocking</strong> – Each victory opens the next challenge, with difficulty ramping up step by step.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Join Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By jumping in today, you’ll get access to all current content <strong>plus every future update for free</strong>.<br>Your feedback will directly shape the game’s evolution — be part of the <strong>Neon Shot</strong> community from the very beginning.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Shot</strong> is a fast-paced physics puzzle game that tests both your reflexes and your mind.<br>Inside a glowing digital maze, your goal is to <strong>pull, aim, and launch</strong> a small neon square with precision. Reaching the target may look simple, but every shot and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time, outsmart cleverly designed obstacles, and conquer each level with skill and strategy. With <strong>intuitive controls</strong>, <strong>deep mechanics</strong>, and a striking neon aesthetic, Neon Shot blends the spirit of classic arcades with modern physics-based gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick &amp; Launch Mechanics</strong> – Pull, aim, release. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Puzzles</strong> – Gravity, friction, ramps, barriers, and more across handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Challenge Mode</strong> – Every second counts. Beat the level, then beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Atmosphere &amp; Synthwave Style</strong> – Retro-futuristic visuals meet electronic soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill + Strategy Balance</strong> – Limited shots and unusual solutions encourage creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocking</strong> – Each victory opens the next challenge, with difficulty ramping up step by step.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Join Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By jumping in today, you’ll get access to all current content <strong>plus every future update for free</strong>.<br>Your feedback will directly shape the game’s evolution — be part of the <strong>Neon Shot</strong> community from the very beginning.</p>",
        "short_description": "A neon-themed physics puzzle game where you flick a glowing square through challenging levels. Launch, bounce, and strategize your way through stylish mazes filled with momentum-based mechanics and time-based goals.",
